  "reflectionText": "Yahweh gave Israel rest all around. Not a man of their enemies stood before them. Nothing failed of any good thing which Yahweh had spoken to the house of Israel. All came to pass. What is it to come at last to the rest your fathers had only been promised, and to find that not one word of the promise has fallen?"
